---
import ChipLink from '../ChipLink.astro';
import PrLink from '../PrLink.astro';

const tse = 'https://github.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint';
const nest = 'https://github.com/nestjs/nest';
---

<section id="experience" class="mb-10">
  <h2 class="section-title">experience</h2>

  <div class="exp-block">
    <h3 class="exp-title">
      framework-agnostic 경량 스크롤 라이브러리 Scrolloop
      <ChipLink href="https://github.com/zaewc/scrolloop" icon="bi-github" label="GitHub" />
      <ChipLink href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/scrolloop" icon="bi-box-seam" label="npm" />
    </h3>
    <ul class="bul-list">
      <li>
        Windowing 기반 가상 스크롤과 무한 스크롤을 <strong>약 40KB, 디펜던시 0개</strong>로 구현
      </li>
      <li>
        n8n·GitHub Actions·3-Agent Harness를 연동해 이슈 라벨링부터 AI 기반 PR 생성까지 자동화
      </li>
      <li>누적 <strong>다운로드 4,700+건, GitHub star 30</strong></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="exp-block">
    <h3 class="exp-title">
      교내 Discord 편의성 봇 JEE6
      <ChipLink href="https://github.com/8G4B/JEE6.v1" icon="bi-github" label="GitHub" />
    </h3>
    <ul class="bul-list">
      <li>서버 관리, 급식 조회, 욕설 메시지 필터, 미니게임 등을 제공하는 Discord 봇</li>
      <li>Docker Compose로 6개 서비스 분리 운영, FastAPI Gateway·Redis TTL 캐싱으로 최적화</li>
      <li>학교 공식 서버를 포함한 <strong>50+개 서버 도입, DAU 100+명</strong></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="exp-block">
    <a href="/ml#project" class="ml-link">
      <span class="ml-link-title">MLOps 엔지니어 경험</span>
      <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ml-link-arrow"></i>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="exp-block">
    <h3 class="exp-title">
      오픈소스 기여
      <ChipLink href="https://github.com/zaewc" icon="bi-github" label="전체 기여 보기" />
    </h3>
    <ul class="bul-list">
      <li>
        <strong>typescript-eslint</strong>
        <ul class="sub-bul-list">
          <li>
            no-floating-promises 등 타입 기반 rule의 오탐 해결
            <PrLink href={`${tse}/pull/11430`} id="#11430" />
            <PrLink href={`${tse}/pull/12443`} id="#12443" />
            <PrLink href="https://velog.io/@haensol/goodfirstissue" id="blog" />
          </li>
          <li>
            scope-manager의 ClassStaticBlockScope export 누락 수정
            <PrLink href={`${tse}/pull/12460`} id="#12460" />
          </li>
          <li>
            require-array-sort-compare, no-loop-func 등 lint rule 정확성 개선
            <PrLink href={`${tse}/pull/12512`} id="#12512" />
            <PrLink href={`${tse}/pull/12500`} id="#12500" />
          </li>
          <li>
            반복적인 rule 성능 측정·테스트 작성 작업을 Agent Skill로 구조화
            <PrLink href={`${tse}/pull/12436`} id="#12436" />
            <PrLink href={`${tse}/pull/12573`} id="#12573" />
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>NestJS</strong>
        <ul class="sub-bul-list">
          <li>
            SSE, 캐시, swagger 관련 unit 및 e2e test 추가
            <PrLink href={`${nest}/pull/16406`} id="#16406" />
            <PrLink href={`${nest}/pull/16409`} id="#16409" />
            <PrLink href={`${nest}/pull/16410`} id="#16410" />
          </li>
          <li>
            Redis microservice의 listen() 경로 pub/sub 클라이언트 타입 전달 오류 수정
            <PrLink href={`${nest}/pull/17331`} id="#17331" />
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>es-toolkit</strong>
        <ul class="sub-bul-list">
          <li>
            누락된 keyBy export를 추가해 문서와의 불일치 해결
            <PrLink href="https://github.com/toss/es-toolkit/pull/1650" id="#1650" />
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .exp-block {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .exp-title {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }
  .sub-bul-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }
  .sub-bul-list > li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .sub-bul-list > li::before {
    content: '◦';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0.1rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .ml-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .ml-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .ml-link:hover .ml-link-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }
  .ml-link-title {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ml-link-arrow {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    transition: transform 0.15s;
  }
</style>
